  <content>A table whose header cells are not associated with their data cells, to produce incomplete checks:

{{html clean="false" wiki="false"}}
&lt;table&gt;
  &lt;caption&gt;Header cells without associated data cells&lt;/caption&gt;
  &lt;tbody&gt;
    &lt;tr&gt;
      &lt;th scope="col"&gt;Column&lt;/th&gt;
      &lt;td&gt;value&lt;/td&gt;
    &lt;/tr&gt;
  &lt;/tbody&gt;
&lt;/table&gt;
{{/html}}</content>
